<Page title="About VendingStartup: Free Vending Route Guides and Math" description="VendingStartup is a free site built on real vending numbers, equipment prices, location commissions, and route math, not vague promises.">
  <p>{site.BRAND} is an independent site. {site.author.bio}</p>

  <h2>What this site is</h2>
  <p>Vending route economics come down to arithmetic most guides skip: machine cost, restock frequency, location commission percentage, and per-slot margin. We publish that math with actual dollar figures pulled from equipment listings and operator-reported commission ranges, so someone weighing a first machine can run the numbers before buying anything.</p>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <p>Figures come from current equipment marketplace listings, distributor price sheets, and commission structures reported by operators in public vending forums and trade materials. Guides are drafted with AI assistance and checked against those sources before publishing, covered in our <a href="/editorial/">editorial policy</a>. We re-check equipment pricing periodically since machine costs shift with the used market.</p>

  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>All of it is free to read, with no paywall. We earn affiliate commissions when readers buy vending equipment or route-building courses through links here, disclosed in full in our <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>Equipment prices and commission ranges move. If a number's stale, tell us through <a href="/contact/">contact</a> and we'll update it with a date.</p>
</Page>
